    "place": "",
    "message": "The passing of Uncle Rajaguru brings us immense sorrow. His humble, simple, and godly life, along with his prayer, preaching, and counseling, greatly benefited many people. He loved, corrected, and encouraged me in numerous ways. He played a significant role in the Tamil literature ministry, undertaking message translation, article selection (especially children's stories), and proofreading for the Tamil magazine 'Jeya Christhu' for many years. He had a special love and concern for Northeast Bible students. When many underprivileged students struggled with their studies, he provided special coaching, helping them retake their exams. We are praying for the comfort of the whole family.",
