    "id": "excel-tribute-93",
    "name": "Isaac Dayakar",
    "place": "Amritsar",
    "message": "It is very sad to hear the departure of Uncle Rajguru yesterday. First of all, my heartfelt condolences to Aunty,  Joseph Rajguru anna, Annie akka and their sons Jordan,Nathan & Ethan  and also sis. Joy & fly members.\nUncle used to visit Hyderabad for preaching regularly once a month. His last sermon in Hyderabad was on Exodus 29:20(Then shalt thou kill the ram, and take of his blood, and put it upon the tip of the right ear of Aaron, and upon the tip of the right ear of his sons, and upon the thumb of their right hand, and upon the great toe of their right foot, and sprinkle the blood upon the altar round about.). And explained in a fabulous way. \n\nHe had an UNASSUMING personality. He was an EXPOSITORY preacher. Many of his messages have only 3 points directly.\nEven though I stayed in B.G. for a short time, by God's grace during one of the Christmas Carols service at B.G., I had a chance to translate his Tamil message into english. I praise God for uncle's life. But missing him till we meet again.",
    "created_at": "2026-11-06T09:13:12.189Z"
