    "id": "excel-tribute-128",
    "name": "",
    "place": "",
    "message": "I praise God for the life of \nRajaguru uncle. He was instrumental in taking the mininstry of the Fellowship to Imphal and later the work spread to the whole of Manipur. Joe uncle used to send him to  Imphal centre regularly to preach the Word and to  strengthen souls which he did faithfully. \n\nThe Lord used him to bring Bro Josiah to the Lord who now along with his wife helps in the ministry at Guwahati. \n\nI remember him preach the Word during vernacular services at headquarters. \nAn unassuming man who served the Lord faithfully. \n\nAs he enters the portals of heaven may he hear his master say, ‘Well done, good and faithful servant. You have been faithful over a little; ……Enter into the joy of your master.’ \n\nPraying for you dear Joseph,Joy & Aunty. May the Lord comfort you all.",
