    "message": "Shocking,  really very sad news.My contemporary , beloved in the Lord\nHe was in Masula sometimes. His son is helping at I  praised the Lord. Friend our Elisha.God used him widely \n\nMay the Lord comfort the family \nSincere condolences \n\nHe is in glryy",
