    "place": "Delhi",
    "message": "It is a shock and a loss not only to the family but also to the ministry of the fellowship and the kingdom of God, the departure of my dear brother Rajguru. As a student, I heard about him and see him since I was in Chennai from 1971 to 1986. I have seen him, heard his testimony, and though I didn't have much interaction with him, the very look at him is an inspiration and encouragement, his soft spoken and always with a winning smile is the gift of God and many are blessd by his spiritual qualities and helpful nature.\n\nHe came to Delhi to share the word of God in one of the Advent Christmas celebrations to the Delhi University students, and he was thrilled to see the Lord's opening and the opportunity to share the word there. He encouraged me  and my wife and I can't forget that. Praise God! May the Lord comfort the dear family members.",
