    "place": "Damdei,Kangpokpi\n              Manipur",
    "message": "⊺ribυte of (ℒ) 𝔟𝔯𝔬. ℛajagυrυ\n\nI met bro Rajaguru in Annual Retreat at St.George school, Chennai in 1984, through (ℒ) Dr.Daniel a MD missionary of ℒ.ℰ.ℱ Tumkur. He was very happy when he came to know that bro Singsit is my cousin, who was his class mate in Madras Christian College in the 70s, the 1st convert in the Fellowship from manipur & NorthEast. He took care of me during the retreat with all my essential needs. I was like a lost coin found to him. Later he came to Imphal to encourage us when the 1st Evangelist deserted ℒ.ℰ.ℱ, before Dr Job's arrival. He was tender, down to earth, like Barnabas of the books of Acts, he took special care, loved the whole N.E brothers & sisters. His gentleness, tenderness & encouraging personality will always linger & stay in our hearts. I shall meet him in Glory along with other saints of the Fellowship when my time is over here. \n\"A great lost for us but a great gain for Heaven\".\nRest in Peace brother untill we meet again....",
