    "place": "",
    "message": "Dear Jeba akka , Joseph and Annie . When I recall the connection which I had with Brother Rajaguru some of the things which came to my mind are : -\n \nNo. 1 He was very much of help in Pasumalai ministry.  About 55 years back I studied in Pasaumalai school. In Pasaumalai school we used to go as a group for prayer in a garden . We used to be very focused in prayer and used to spend  2-3 hours in prayer . \n\nNo. 2 There was a prayer room in Pasaumalai school were we used to spend a lot of time in prayer .\n\nNo. 3 The prayer we did in the early days gave us a lot of strength to work for God.\n\nNo. 4 Brother Rajaguru was a great help in LEF Madurai ministry. \n\nWe thank God for the life of  Brother Rajaguru.",
