    "message": "My deep condolences to Br. Rajaguru’s family - sister Jeba, Joseph, Annie, and Joy and family. May our Lord comfort and strengthen you all. \n\nBrother was one of the very few persons who was gentle, calm, kind-hearted, humble, and a spiritually dedicated man.\n\nThanking & praising God for such a person who worked in building God’s kingdom. May his godly legacy be upon his children and future generations.",
